(3168700, 445183, 66223, '<td valign="top">AMAZING!  the thin blue border is a perfect match for the colors of the fireworks.  amazing timing, since with this many fireworks going off at once it is likely there were only a few moments in the entire show where something like this was possible, and you luckily caught it!!! (BTW, i''m biased towards images with beautiful representation of the color blue, but regardless this is a great image!)</td>', 'AMAZING!  the thin blue border is a perfect match for the colors of the fireworks.  amazing timing, since with this many fireworks going off at once it is likely there were only a few moments in the entire show where something like this was possible, and you luckily caught it!!! (BTW, i''m biased towards images with beautiful representation of the color blue, but regardless this is a great image!)', '2007-01-02 00:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
