(3169029, 445420, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  It almost looks like a painting.  The landscape of houses on the water.  I know this was a quick challenge and you may not have had the luxury of time to perfect the processing.   The far right side of the image has a lot of chatter and It may have helped this to smooth it out some.   Its still a stunning entry and one of my favorites of the challenge so far.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  It almost looks like a painting.  The landscape of houses on the water.  I know this was a quick challenge and you may not have had the luxury of time to perfect the processing.   The far right side of the image has a lot of chatter and It may have helped this to smooth it out some.   Its still a stunning entry and one of my favorites of the challenge so far.', '2007-01-02 02:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
