(3169821, 446101, 10390, '<td valign="top">A little movement there has a bad affect on the outcome and almost ruins it for my taste. Using the self timer on the camera (or a shutter release cable) and putting it on a tripod or stable surface will help you get sharper images without movements of the still motives.  Happy new year and better luck next time. 2 from me.</td>', 'A little movement there has a bad affect on the outcome and almost ruins it for my taste. Using the self timer on the camera (or a shutter release cable) and putting it on a tripod or stable surface will help you get sharper images without movements of the still motives.  Happy new year and better luck next time. 2 from me.', '2007-01-02 09:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
