(3169940, 446074, 10390, '<td valign="top">A good choice of motive. The framing could be better, aiming it more upwards closer to the peoples feet and just a little bit more to the right would have made this photo great. 6 from me, happy new year and good luck!</td>', 'A good choice of motive. The framing could be better, aiming it more upwards closer to the peoples feet and just a little bit more to the right would have made this photo great. 6 from me, happy new year and good luck!', '2007-01-02 10:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
