(3171481, 445183, 32968, '<td valign="top">And that folks, is a photo of fireworks, just the way it should be done. Loads of color, definition, and crispy focus. Beautiful job. The light is often so bright that a lot of fireworks go "hot" in photos, but these are saturated with  rich color. Nice editing work. Small "dead" spot in the top left but that''s all part of shooting fireworks. Like the framing as well. 9</td>', 'And that folks, is a photo of fireworks, just the way it should be done. Loads of color, definition, and crispy focus. Beautiful job. The light is often so bright that a lot of fireworks go "hot" in photos, but these are saturated with  rich color. Nice editing work. Small "dead" spot in the top left but that''s all part of shooting fireworks. Like the framing as well. 9', '2007-01-02 16:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3171482, 445420, 32968, '<td valign="top">The light is very hot but otherwise this is a lovely shot. Great colors and clarity. Looks like HDR, yah? Nice work. 9</td>', 'The light is very hot but otherwise this is a lovely shot. Great colors and clarity. Looks like HDR, yah? Nice work. 9', '2007-01-02 16:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
