(3171596, 445661, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s the photo that takes my breathe away or the fact that there''s so many people in your city that actually light off fireworks all together. If it''s the second then you still get many kudos for capturing the act. The cloud rolling in adds a detail of interest. Everyone always shoots for that perfect clean black boring sky. I''m not yet done voting, but this is probably my top pick. I hope others agree.<br/> <br/>=)</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s the photo that takes my breathe away or the fact that there''s so many people in your city that actually light off fireworks all together. If it''s the second then you still get many kudos for capturing the act. The cloud rolling in adds a detail of interest. Everyone always shoots for that perfect clean black boring sky. I''m not yet done voting, but this is probably my top pick. I hope others agree. =)', '2007-01-02 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
