(3183383, 445863, 42100, '<td valign="top">The composition and exposure are great in this photo.  I get the artisticness of blurred areas, but am really undecided about whether it works for me or not.  I''m sure some the voting on this is a bit polarized.  But I do like the technicals, and especially the grain in the smoke.</td>', 'The composition and exposure are great in this photo.  I get the artisticness of blurred areas, but am really undecided about whether it works for me or not.  I''m sure some the voting on this is a bit polarized.  But I do like the technicals, and especially the grain in the smoke.', '2007-01-04 23:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183432, 445644, 45194, '<td valign="top">For me the photo does not meet the challenge (man I hate saying that).  The photo is decent but not spectacular. If you score really low on the photo I imagine it''s because people don''t see how it fits the fireworks theme.  Having a good photo sometimes seems less important at DPC than actually meeting the challenge dead on. Make sure the audience clearly sees you met the challenge and THEN make it a good shot and you''ll score much higher.  Good luck.</td>', 'For me the photo does not meet the challenge (man I hate saying that).  The photo is decent but not spectacular. If you score really low on the photo I imagine it''s because people don''t see how it fits the fireworks theme.  Having a good photo sometimes seems less important at DPC than actually meeting the challenge dead on. Make sure the audience clearly sees you met the challenge and THEN make it a good shot and you''ll score much higher.  Good luck.', '2007-01-04 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183444, 446096, 45194, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the photo doesn''t make me curious to know what he''s doing.  The red glow and smoke are the only thing that make this appear to be fireworks but  it''s not enough to really make it stand out for me.</td>', 'Unfortunately the photo doesn''t make me curious to know what he''s doing.  The red glow and smoke are the only thing that make this appear to be fireworks but  it''s not enough to really make it stand out for me.', '2007-01-04 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183456, 446071, 45194, '<td valign="top">Shooting fireworks in black and white is risky.  While you might have done it to be artistic, the whole point of fireworks is that they are colorful and pretty. Desaturating the shot makes it quite boring.  The composition of the photo also does nothing for me and the car/bus and light in the background are more distracting than helpful.</td>', 'Shooting fireworks in black and white is risky.  While you might have done it to be artistic, the whole point of fireworks is that they are colorful and pretty. Desaturating the shot makes it quite boring.  The composition of the photo also does nothing for me and the car/bus and light in the background are more distracting than helpful.', '2007-01-04 23:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183461, 445420, 45194, '<td valign="top">My dead nuts favorite in the challenge. Outstanding shot.  I''m certain it''s a ribbon...probably the blue.</td>', 'My dead nuts favorite in the challenge. Outstanding shot.  I''m certain it''s a ribbon...probably the blue.', '2007-01-04 23:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183477, 446033, 45194, '<td valign="top">My second favorite shot in the challenge.  Outstanding! If you don''t ribbon you''ve been robbed...but I''m sure you know you''re going to ribbon with this one.  My only complaint is that the horizon seems the slight bit tilted to the right. Maybe it''s just me.</td>', 'My second favorite shot in the challenge.  Outstanding! If you don''t ribbon you''ve been robbed...but I''m sure you know you''re going to ribbon with this one.  My only complaint is that the horizon seems the slight bit tilted to the right. Maybe it''s just me.', '2007-01-04 23:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183915, 445682, 71228, '<td valign="top">Þessi mynd fékk hæstu einkunn frá mér á LMK.. get reyndar ekki gefið henni einkunn hér en hvað um það, myndi fá mína hæstu einkunn hér líka sýnist mér.</td>', 'Þessi mynd fékk hæstu einkunn frá mér á LMK.. get reyndar ekki gefið henni einkunn hér en hvað um það, myndi fá mína hæstu einkunn hér líka sýnist mér.', '2007-01-05 03:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183942, 445747, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I can tell you that I personally would have voted this higher if you had not inverted it but I can´t really say I dislike it like this though, voted a 5.</td>', 'Well I can tell you that I personally would have voted this higher if you had not inverted it but I can´t really say I dislike it like this though, voted a 5.', '2007-01-05 03:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183943, 445787, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the image quality in this shot is not good, way too noisy and needs to be considerably clearer and crisper to work for me but keep in mind I am picky.  I do like the panorama aspect of it though although that will hurt your score here undoubtedly.  Voted a 4 solely on the image quality.</td>', 'Sorry but the image quality in this shot is not good, way too noisy and needs to be considerably clearer and crisper to work for me but keep in mind I am picky.  I do like the panorama aspect of it though although that will hurt your score here undoubtedly.  Voted a 4 solely on the image quality.', '2007-01-05 03:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183960, 445634, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot depicting what is going on here in Reykjavik during newyears, I like it but I have also seen better, the choice of foreground could have been better.<br/> <br/>Og muna nota 720 pixla þegar þeir eru í boði :)</td>', 'Pretty nice shot depicting what is going on here in Reykjavik during newyears, I like it but I have also seen better, the choice of foreground could have been better. Og muna nota 720 pixla þegar þeir eru í boði :)', '2007-01-05 04:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
