(3185704, 446068, 27482, '<td valign="top">Fireworks are nice but having seen so many of them I really need something else in the frame to make it work for me, foreground or backround...  5</td>', 'Fireworks are nice but having seen so many of them I really need something else in the frame to make it work for me, foreground or backround...  5', '2007-01-05 17:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185711, 445792, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot BUT, this is a challenge about fireworks and it took me a good 3-4 seconds to actually find the firework in this shot, that sky is just WAY to prominant and dramatic and attention stealing for this challenge in my opinion.  I went so far as to knock off a point cause of that but just 1.  I do like the shot though but again, the sky just looks too wierd for me.  Don´t know cause it´s from long exposure movement or some wierd filter you put on it in post processing but it´s just not to my taste.  I do like the use of purple vs. orange.  Bottom line is I voted 6.</td>', 'Nice shot BUT, this is a challenge about fireworks and it took me a good 3-4 seconds to actually find the firework in this shot, that sky is just WAY to prominant and dramatic and attention stealing for this challenge in my opinion.  I went so far as to knock off a point cause of that but just 1.  I do like the shot though but again, the sky just looks too wierd for me.  Don´t know cause it´s from long exposure movement or some wierd filter you put on it in post processing but it´s just not to my taste.  I do like the use of purple vs. orange.  Bottom line is I voted 6.', '2007-01-05 17:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185714, 445502, 44877, '<td valign="top">Did you capture a ghostie in the front of the picture, or how did that happen? The photo is grainy and out of focus, but I really like it - good colors, good capture of the scene.</td>', 'Did you capture a ghostie in the front of the picture, or how did that happen? The photo is grainy and out of focus, but I really like it - good colors, good capture of the scene.', '2007-01-05 17:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185720, 445363, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I guess this is taken in Iceland.  All I can say is one of the most original and refreshing fireworks shot I have ever seen, instant 10 and a fave.  I personally would have darkened the sky though to draw the aurora out more but that´s just nitpicking.<br/> <br/>Wish I had taken this and hope you win!</td>', 'Well I guess this is taken in Iceland.  All I can say is one of the most original and refreshing fireworks shot I have ever seen, instant 10 and a fave.  I personally would have darkened the sky though to draw the aurora out more but that´s just nitpicking. Wish I had taken this and hope you win!', '2007-01-05 17:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185728, 445148, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am terribly sorry but I can´t understand why you chose to make this b/w, I can´t imagine it looked better monotone.  Shame as I like the castle and this had potential, I at least like the composition.  5 from me.</td>', 'I am terribly sorry but I can´t understand why you chose to make this b/w, I can´t imagine it looked better monotone.  Shame as I like the castle and this had potential, I at least like the composition.  5 from me.', '2007-01-05 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185733, 446101, 27482, '<td valign="top">I assume you know this already but just in case...  The shot suffers from motion blur, would have vastly improved it if you had used a tripod.  I like the christmas lights around the firework though so just use a tripod next time and your all set.</td>', 'I assume you know this already but just in case...  The shot suffers from motion blur, would have vastly improved it if you had used a tripod.  I like the christmas lights around the firework though so just use a tripod next time and your all set.', '2007-01-05 17:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
