(3185878, 445756, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but for me this is just not a very interesting photo.  First off it´s black and white wich means no interesting colors as what is so good about fireworks in the first place.  Secondly, there is no real detail in the shot, blown highlights or just pitch black with a hint of a hand in the right corner and I really require image quality to like most shot´s.  Unless this is all intentional I encourage you to use a smaller aperture/lower ISO or both next time when shooting fireworks.  Thus I voted 3.</td>', 'Sorry but for me this is just not a very interesting photo.  First off it´s black and white wich means no interesting colors as what is so good about fireworks in the first place.  Secondly, there is no real detail in the shot, blown highlights or just pitch black with a hint of a hand in the right corner and I really require image quality to like most shot´s.  Unless this is all intentional I encourage you to use a smaller aperture/lower ISO or both next time when shooting fireworks.  Thus I voted 3.', '2007-01-05 18:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185885, 446031, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the fireworks part of the photo, the foreground is not as good but I like that you at least had a foreground.  Wish it had more neutral color and was not so yellowish and that hotel sign is too bright and draws too much attention to it, I would presonally have darkened it in post processing.  6 from me.</td>', 'I like the fireworks part of the photo, the foreground is not as good but I like that you at least had a foreground.  Wish it had more neutral color and was not so yellowish and that hotel sign is too bright and draws too much attention to it, I would presonally have darkened it in post processing.  6 from me.', '2007-01-05 18:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3185893, 445771, 27482, '<td valign="top">Fireworks are nice but having seen so many of them I really need something else in the frame to make it work for me, foreground or backround...  5</td>', 'Fireworks are nice but having seen so many of them I really need something else in the frame to make it work for me, foreground or backround...  5', '2007-01-05 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
