(3186432, 446074, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I do not want to go so far as to say this image is "stolen" but when looking at <a href="//www.ljosmyndakeppni.is/resultimage.php?imageid=2189&amp;challengeid=99" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> photo that won a fireworks competition there last year and the fact that this exact shot is in the voting stages in a challenge at ljosmyndakeppni.is right now makes it considerably less appealing to me, at least you could have tried taking it form a different angle or something, this is exactly the same except your shot is just a tad wider. <br/> <br/>I frankly voted a 5 on this as I feel you could have done a lot better and interesting things at this location.</td>', 'Well I do not want to go so far as to say this image is "stolen" but when looking at this photo that won a fireworks competition there last year and the fact that this exact shot is in the voting stages in a challenge at ljosmyndakeppni.is right now makes it considerably less appealing to me, at least you could have tried taking it form a different angle or something, this is exactly the same except your shot is just a tad wider.  I frankly voted a 5 on this as I feel you could have done a lot better and interesting things at this location.', '2007-01-05 20:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186434, 446096, 27482, '<td valign="top">I at least hope he´s not peeing on a firework :)</td>', 'I at least hope he´s not peeing on a firework :)', '2007-01-05 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186442, 446033, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I feel like something is missing to make it really pop.  A firework high up int he sky for instance, they are all so close to the ground, think that´s the biggest "problem".  Anyway, nice shot though and I voted a 6.</td>', 'Nice shot but I feel like something is missing to make it really pop.  A firework high up int he sky for instance, they are all so close to the ground, think that´s the biggest "problem".  Anyway, nice shot though and I voted a 6.', '2007-01-05 20:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186451, 445443, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the addition of the bonfire but would have liked it even more if it were not so completely blown out.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the addition of the bonfire but would have liked it even more if it were not so completely blown out.  6 from me.', '2007-01-05 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186495, 446122, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the sky, just think there is something missing, like a more difinitive pattern of the light or a figure standing there or something but keep it up and experiment more, this is promising :)</td>', 'I like the idea and the sky, just think there is something missing, like a more difinitive pattern of the light or a figure standing there or something but keep it up and experiment more, this is promising :)', '2007-01-05 21:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
