(3186594, 445690, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this shot seems a bit out of focus to me, anyway it could be clearer whatever the fault is and it hurt the score I gave it.  5 from me.</td>', 'Sorry but this shot seems a bit out of focus to me, anyway it could be clearer whatever the fault is and it hurt the score I gave it.  5 from me.', '2007-01-05 21:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186602, 445891, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whatever the cause, I guess mostly post processing, I don´t really care for the grain on the backround and the way it fades, nor rather doesn´t fade into the black bacround, like you darkened parts of this photo and didn´t do a very good job at it, sorry :(</td>', 'Whatever the cause, I guess mostly post processing, I don´t really care for the grain on the backround and the way it fades, nor rather doesn´t fade into the black bacround, like you darkened parts of this photo and didn´t do a very good job at it, sorry :(', '2007-01-05 21:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186610, 445745, 27482, '<td valign="top">Above average in this challenge for me, I like the inclusion of the city here but well frankly the fireworks don´t really impress me.  Still good enough for a 6.</td>', 'Above average in this challenge for me, I like the inclusion of the city here but well frankly the fireworks don´t really impress me.  Still good enough for a 6.', '2007-01-05 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186616, 445723, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not a bad shot really but kindof doesn´t impress me as much as the big fireworks on most photos here.  Maybe shooting it from a lower angle, like down by the ground would have made it appear bigger and more impressive?</td>', 'Well not a bad shot really but kindof doesn´t impress me as much as the big fireworks on most photos here.  Maybe shooting it from a lower angle, like down by the ground would have made it appear bigger and more impressive?', '2007-01-05 21:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186621, 445420, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, the reflection and coloring especially.  Firework a bit blown for my taste though but still good enough for a 8 from me, hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, the reflection and coloring especially.  Firework a bit blown for my taste though but still good enough for a 8 from me, hope you do well in the challenge.', '2007-01-05 21:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186624, 445777, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, without that house in it this shot would have just been yet another shot of fireworks but that bumps it up a bit.  Still not dropping my jaw over this but good work.</td>', 'Not bad, without that house in it this shot would have just been yet another shot of fireworks but that bumps it up a bit.  Still not dropping my jaw over this but good work.', '2007-01-05 21:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186635, 445748, 27482, '<td valign="top">The reflection is a nice touch but too bad the water was moving, would have been great if they had been reflected perfectly.</td>', 'The reflection is a nice touch but too bad the water was moving, would have been great if they had been reflected perfectly.', '2007-01-05 21:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186638, 445736, 27482, '<td valign="top">I find this a bit under average compared to most shot´s in the challenge, in particular the foreground pier could be way clearer and the fireworks are really not very impressive to most others in the challenge, that´s why I voted a 4.</td>', 'I find this a bit under average compared to most shot´s in the challenge, in particular the foreground pier could be way clearer and the fireworks are really not very impressive to most others in the challenge, that´s why I voted a 4.', '2007-01-05 21:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186639, 445280, 27482, '<td valign="top">I find this shot neither good nor bad, voted a 5 on it.  Like that you included the setting, the city but think the fireworks are pretty weak compared to most in the challenge and composition way too centered + that building with the blue roof in the corner draws my attention.</td>', 'I find this shot neither good nor bad, voted a 5 on it.  Like that you included the setting, the city but think the fireworks are pretty weak compared to most in the challenge and composition way too centered + that building with the blue roof in the corner draws my attention.', '2007-01-05 21:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186644, 445747, 63006, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, very different from all the other pictures of fireworks.. they get kind of redundant after awhile, and the take on this is awesome :)9</td>', 'I like this one a lot, very different from all the other pictures of fireworks.. they get kind of redundant after awhile, and the take on this is awesome :)9', '2007-01-05 21:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186677, 445738, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not bad but I find photos that consist almost 98% of just fireworks pretty boring so I only voted this a 5, you need an interesting fore/backround to impress me.</td>', 'Well not bad but I find photos that consist almost 98% of just fireworks pretty boring so I only voted this a 5, you need an interesting fore/backround to impress me.', '2007-01-05 21:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186679, 445316, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but photos that just have fireworks in them and nothing else don´t impress me anymore, you need a back/foreground or something else interesting to impress me.  Also you are probably aware of this but just in case, your shot has some severly blown out highlights, try decreasing the iso and/or using a smaller aperture next time.  Voted this a 4.</td>', 'Sorry but photos that just have fireworks in them and nothing else don´t impress me anymore, you need a back/foreground or something else interesting to impress me.  Also you are probably aware of this but just in case, your shot has some severly blown out highlights, try decreasing the iso and/or using a smaller aperture next time.  Voted this a 4.', '2007-01-05 22:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186680, 445744, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this certainly stands out and pretty refreshing take on the challenge, gave it a 7, I really like the composition and DOF.</td>', 'Well this certainly stands out and pretty refreshing take on the challenge, gave it a 7, I really like the composition and DOF.', '2007-01-05 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186682, 445501, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not bad but I have not been impressed by photos of just fireworks for a while now, I need something more, like an interesting fore/backround for example.  Not bad so I voted 5.</td>', 'Well not bad but I have not been impressed by photos of just fireworks for a while now, I need something more, like an interesting fore/backround for example.  Not bad so I voted 5.', '2007-01-05 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186684, 445215, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well the motion blur on the trees and lights in the backround is not making this image better, would have preferred it if they were not moved so I voted this a 4.</td>', 'Well the motion blur on the trees and lights in the backround is not making this image better, would have preferred it if they were not moved so I voted this a 4.', '2007-01-05 22:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186688, 445333, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, gave it a 7, like everything about it except I would have wanted a wider shot to see all the firework or at least more of it and also it´s kindof too blown out for my taste, the rest I like.</td>', 'Very nice shot, gave it a 7, like everything about it except I would have wanted a wider shot to see all the firework or at least more of it and also it´s kindof too blown out for my taste, the rest I like.', '2007-01-05 22:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3186690, 445682, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well if I have ever seen a b/w photo of fireworks that works, this is the closes to it.  Still think I would have liked it better in color but this is not half bad, that church is always gloomy and dark no matter what a photographer does with it :)</td>', 'Well if I have ever seen a b/w photo of fireworks that works, this is the closes to it.  Still think I would have liked it better in color but this is not half bad, that church is always gloomy and dark no matter what a photographer does with it :)', '2007-01-05 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
