(3200140, 445744, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is great!  A refreshing change from the "normal" shots.  And look at that average vote from commenters! :)</td>', 'This is great!  A refreshing change from the "normal" shots.  And look at that average vote from commenters! :)', '2007-01-09 12:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
