(3200313, 445363, 35350, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great combination!  You did well getting the light balance, congradulations.</td>', 'Wow, what a great combination!  You did well getting the light balance, congradulations.', '2007-01-09 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200543, 445363, 656, '<td valign="top">Quite stunning.  The bit of luck getting the lights to frame the firework explosion, combined with the effort you put in to be there in the first place really paid off in a big way.</td>', 'Quite stunning.  The bit of luck getting the lights to frame the firework explosion, combined with the effort you put in to be there in the first place really paid off in a big way.', '2007-01-09 13:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200587, 445363, 23430, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I like how you set this up. Congratulations on your first ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent shot. I like how you set this up. Congratulations on your first ribbon.', '2007-01-09 13:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200594, 445420, 65025, '<td valign="top">Great use of HDR to make this one have so much detail!</td>', 'Great use of HDR to make this one have so much detail!', '2007-01-09 14:04:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200600, 445363, 65025, '<td valign="top">This is really great!  Nice planning to get just the shot you wanted.</td>', 'This is really great!  Nice planning to get just the shot you wanted.', '2007-01-09 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200601, 445420, 23430, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this great shot Bear. Well deserved RED.</td>', 'Congratulations on this great shot Bear. Well deserved RED.', '2007-01-09 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200607, 445183, 23430, '<td valign="top">Well done Firsty. Very nice colourful shot. Your processing has given it a very professional look. Congrats on another high score and BLUE ribbon.</td>', 'Well done Firsty. Very nice colourful shot. Your processing has given it a very professional look. Congrats on another high score and BLUE ribbon.', '2007-01-09 14:09:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200631, 445363, 40386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I cant help but ask if that small brownish thing directly under the firework as it goes straight up (under the vertical streak) is the person setting it off?<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the ribbon<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-09 14:17:16.</i></td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I cant help but ask if that small brownish thing directly under the firework as it goes straight up (under the vertical streak) is the person setting it off? Congratulations on the ribbon', '2007-01-09 14:16:46.000000', '2007-01-09 14:17:16.000000', 0),
(3200687, 445443, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bbright:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey!  Where''s the story?!  Inquiring minds want to know...  :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well, don''t worry - nothing bad happened.  Big bonfires together with firework shows are tradition here in Iceland on new year''s eve :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/>That''s a BONFIRE!!!  Yikes, it''s HUGE!  Well, I guess that''s one way of keeping warm.  :D</td>', 'Originally posted by bbright: Originally posted by glad2badad: Hey!  Where''s the story?!  Inquiring minds want to know...  :D  Well, don''t worry - nothing bad happened.  Big bonfires together with firework shows are tradition here in Iceland on new year''s eve :D  That''s a BONFIRE!!!  Yikes, it''s HUGE!  Well, I guess that''s one way of keeping warm.  :D', '2007-01-09 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200868, 445744, 23484, '<td valign="top">Deb, this is really a nice shot and you should definitely receive the OOBIE for this one. I can almost smell the burnt powder just looking at this.</td>', 'Deb, this is really a nice shot and you should definitely receive the OOBIE for this one. I can almost smell the burnt powder just looking at this.', '2007-01-09 15:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3200907, 445420, 60141, '<td valign="top">love the dreamy painted quality of the town...superb!</td>', 'love the dreamy painted quality of the town...superb!', '2007-01-09 15:31:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201099, 445792, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great job. Love those sparkles in the upper right :-) and the mountains are wonderful!</td>', 'Great job. Love those sparkles in the upper right :-) and the mountains are wonderful!', '2007-01-09 16:39:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201109, 445759, 31133, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!! This is one of my favorites. What a beautiful capture in the studio. I''m really impressed - and happy for you!</td>', 'Congratulations!! This is one of my favorites. What a beautiful capture in the studio. I''m really impressed - and happy for you!', '2007-01-09 16:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201563, 445420, 24846, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I couldn''t imagine anyone in the pictured homes would not want to buy an enlarged print. I do and I''m in Omaha...great work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I couldn''t imagine anyone in the pictured homes would not want to buy an enlarged print. I do and I''m in Omaha...great work.', '2007-01-09 18:58:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201565, 445183, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wow, a Sydney postcard.</td>', 'Wow, a Sydney postcard.', '2007-01-09 18:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201571, 445363, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great image, what a wonderful planet we share.</td>', 'Great image, what a wonderful planet we share.', '2007-01-09 19:01:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201622, 445183, 28532, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - Congrats on the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful shot - Congrats on the blue ribbon!', '2007-01-09 19:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201639, 445744, 14620, '<td valign="top">I loved this photo.  It was a nice change from all the flashy lights.  The textures of it all are fabulous!</td>', 'I loved this photo.  It was a nice change from all the flashy lights.  The textures of it all are fabulous!', '2007-01-09 19:33:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201659, 445363, 3575, '<td valign="top">Truly an amazing scene. It''s not too difficult to shoot fireworks so in order to get a ribbon with this challenge, the shot had to be so much more on many levels. Your incorporation with the Northern Lights really is amazing. Compositionwise, it''s nearly perfect but it has so much more great stuff I won''t even complain about the cut off on the top. And the colors...could there have been a better combination than orange and green? I don''t think so.<br/>Thanks for being so dedicated in order to bring us this awesome visual treat.</td>', 'Truly an amazing scene. It''s not too difficult to shoot fireworks so in order to get a ribbon with this challenge, the shot had to be so much more on many levels. Your incorporation with the Northern Lights really is amazing. Compositionwise, it''s nearly perfect but it has so much more great stuff I won''t even complain about the cut off on the top. And the colors...could there have been a better combination than orange and green? I don''t think so.Thanks for being so dedicated in order to bring us this awesome visual treat.', '2007-01-09 19:43:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201661, 445891, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like your OOBie approach to this challenge -- using the literal definition for "fire". The score is quite decent for an OOB shot too. <br/> <br/>I like the shot and gave it a 7 for the brilliant colors. I''m not fond of the composition of the shot though. Not sure why, maybe too horizontal. I don''t think it needs the sparkly noise, but I don''t mind it. <br/> <br/>This reminds me of some of those Icelandic sky shots. It might be fun to play with it in Expert Editing mode -- using the flames for the sky of some landscape.</td>', 'I like your OOBie approach to this challenge -- using the literal definition for "fire". The score is quite decent for an OOB shot too.  I like the shot and gave it a 7 for the brilliant colors. I''m not fond of the composition of the shot though. Not sure why, maybe too horizontal. I don''t think it needs the sparkly noise, but I don''t mind it.  This reminds me of some of those Icelandic sky shots. It might be fun to play with it in Expert Editing mode -- using the flames for the sky of some landscape.', '2007-01-09 19:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201676, 445744, 66384, '<td valign="top">Melethis, I''m sorry, I didn''t score this very high. I''m afraid it brought that dreadful dead cat photo immediately to my mind, and I was instantly turned off. Not your fault, my dear. It''s well done and a good OOB entry.</td>', 'Melethis, I''m sorry, I didn''t score this very high. I''m afraid it brought that dreadful dead cat photo immediately to my mind, and I was instantly turned off. Not your fault, my dear. It''s well done and a good OOB entry.', '2007-01-09 19:48:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201690, 445799, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I gave it an 8, I think because of the top being out of the frame. Actually the crop seems too tight all the way around. What I love about it is the way you captured the feathery effect caused by the wind.</td>', 'Good shot. I gave it an 8, I think because of the top being out of the frame. Actually the crop seems too tight all the way around. What I love about it is the way you captured the feathery effect caused by the wind.', '2007-01-09 19:53:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201695, 445744, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Deb. Nice composition and some wonderful textures. Great eye!</td>', 'Great shot, Deb. Nice composition and some wonderful textures. Great eye!', '2007-01-09 19:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3201699, 445420, 20066, '<td valign="top">very nice photo</td>', 'very nice photo', '2007-01-09 19:56:18.000000', NULL, 0),
